<title>UK: HTV stumbles after annual results.</title>
<headline>HTV stumbles after annual results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in HTV Group Plc stumbled at the open on Wednesday as the UK broadcasting group disappointed investors with its annual profits.</p>
<p>At 0839 GMT, the shares were down 9p to 351-1/2, paring the 33-1/2p advance sustained during the past two weeks.  </p>
<p>The company said its operating profits rose to a lower-than-expected 12.6 million stg in the year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The shares initially dropped as low as 337p, but dealers said the sharp mark down attracted fresh buying.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
